<h1 id=3D"OmniOut(SharpenDB)-ConfiguringSharpenDB2"><strong>Configuring Sha=
rpenDB2</strong></h1>
<p>Now that you have added your campaign and campaign statuses, you are rea=
dy to add contacts to your campaign via SharpenDB2. You=E2=80=99ll need to =
create a new table with a specific layout to ensure the contacts are access=
ible from your OmniOut campaign.</p>
<p>To navigate to SharpenDB2, you=E2=80=99ll need to use the link below tha=
t is associated with your environment.</p>
<p>IZ0 =E2=80=93 <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://app.sharpencx.c=
om/sharpenDB2/" rel=3D"nofollow">https://app.sharpencx.com/sharpenDB2/</a><=
/p>
<p>IZ1 =E2=80=93 <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://app.iz1.sharpen=
.cx/sharpenDB2/" rel=3D"nofollow">https://app.iz1.sharpen.cx/sharpenDB2/</a=
></p>
<p>Click on =E2=80=9CNew Table=E2=80=9D in the top left corner and name the=
 table for your OmniOut Campaign</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file=
-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=
=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"image-20250221-224228.pn=
g" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"b2e5d186657f2714bf909a2ff68ebb9605=
