<p>Click =E2=80=9CStructure=E2=80=9D</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-=
file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img cla=
ss=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"image-20250221-224502.=
