<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Since you=E2=80=99ve done the hard work of setting=
 up your table, we=E2=80=99d recommend adding a contact manually and then e=
xporting the CSV first. That way, you don=E2=80=99t have to worry about acc=
identally mistyping any column headers and all of your data cleanly maps to=
 your new DB table. To do this, click the export button and then Generate N=
ew Report. You=E2=80=99ll then see your requested DB exports below. Select =
your report and download (not delete).</p>
<h1 id=3D"OmniOut(SharpenDB)-ConfiguringOmniOut"><strong>Configuring OmniOu=
t</strong></h1>
<p>To configure OmniOut and link your database, from the Admin section Conf=
iguration, select =E2=80=9COmniOut=E2=80=9D</p><span class=3D"confluence-em=
