" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-20250220-234822.png" data-bas=
e-url=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content=
-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"4509466637" data-l=
inked-resource-container-version=3D"12" data-media-id=3D"3fae45ad-4443-4834=
-af7c-0e03a0173c2b" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"229"></span>
<p>Select the days of the week, the time zone, and the hours in which the c=
ampaign should run. To utilize multiple timezones, follow this article. <a =
href=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CT1/pages/3025108995/Ti=
mezone+Support+for+OmniOut" data-linked-resource-id=3D"3025108995" data-lin=
ked-resource-version=3D"8" data-linked-resource-type=3D"page">Timezone Supp=
ort for OmniOut</a></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper imag=
e-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-=
embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"image-20250220-234919.png" width=3D"468=
" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"dd6634841da0ad52157c8e850c34f6d7cccafeb1d12469826=
b95330e942599d6" data-image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/dow=
nload/attachments/4509466637/image-20250220-234919.png?version=3D1&amp;modi=
ficationDate=3D1740095360755&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=
